---
// Silver thread gate: the ground, the stroke the script lays out, and a full-screen open control.
---

<div class="silver-thread__ground" data-silver-thread-ground aria-hidden="true"></div>
<svg class="silver-thread" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
	<path class="silver-thread__path" data-silver-thread-path d=""></path>
</svg>
<button
	type="button"
	class="silver-thread__trigger"
	data-envelope-open
	data-screenshot="reveal-trigger"
	disabled
	aria-label="Abrir la invitación"></button>
